<title>USA: U.S. Trust Corp sets stock split, buyback.</title>
<headline>U.S. Trust Corp sets stock split, buyback.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Trust Corp said on Tuesday it had approved a two-for-one stock split and authorized the repurchase of up to 500,000 common-stock shares, or 1 million after the stock split.</p>
<p>The two-for-one split is payable on February 21 to shareholders of record on February 7.</p>
<p>The repurchase will be made in the open market or in directly negotiated buys. This action brings the total number of U.S. Trust shares authorized for repurchase to 938,000, or about 1.8 million after the stock split.</p>
